name: '''
[#70AC30]Darkheartium []Liquid
'''

description: '''
A dangerous liquid made by either melting [#70AC30]darkheartium []into a liquid or as by-product of the [#70AC30]darkheartium []reactor,
will spread to anything that contains water, can stay on the surface for quite some time before being boiled off, applies [#70AC30]darkheart's []curse to any ground units that may touch the liquid,
extremely useful when used offensively.
[grey]and yes i know it's basically a modified neoplasm liquid.
'''

details: '''
[#70AC30]a bit of chaos is fun... don't you think?
'''
type: CellLiquid
heatCapacity: 0
temperature: 0.5
explosiveness: 13
viscosity: 0.85
flammability: 6.66
effect: darkhearts-curse
boilPoint: 1
coolant: false
capPuddles: false
moveThroughBlocks: true
color: 517C22
colorFrom: 6DA82E
colorTo: 2B4212
canStayOn: [
    "water",
    "illuminaium-ichor",
  ],
incinerable: true
spreadTarget: water
maxSpread: 10
spreadConversion: 1
spreadDamage: 50
removeScaling: 0.6
  research: {
    parent: darkheartium
    requirements: [
]
}
